3060405,"media":null,"username":"lisa_catara","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":8,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":932308819362824192,"date":1511114718000,"rawContent":"Well the #Oscars are going to be interesting: \"I'd like to thank the Academy, Harvey Wei... oh nevermind. Um, my Agent... wait, no... Costar? No, NOT him... er...um... I'd like to thank craft services. Shout out to crafty.\" #weinsteinscandal #Hollywood #metoo @anopensecret","userId":793060405,"media":null,"username":"lisa_catara","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":9,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":942213024005332992,"date":1513476065000,"rawContent":"@DEADLINE Black? That's a STAPLE for award ceremonies. And it can be associated with grief &amp; loss. If my fellow actresses want to appear STRONG and send a message of Unity &amp; transcendence... wear BRIGHT colors. That's iconic. And not silent \ud83c\udfad #GoldenGlobes #actress #hollywood  #metoo","userId":793060405,"media":null,"username":"lisa_catara","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":10,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":947921804009467904,"date":1514837144000,"rawContent":"@PattyJenks Thankful many are staying vocal. Though I disagree w\/wearing black at the Golden Globes. Black is the color of mourning &amp; is common attire at awards venues. If we want to make a statement of Power and Transcendence, wear BRIGHT colors! #metoo #TimesUp","userId":793060405,"media":null,"username":"lisa_catara","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":11,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":947948151159140352,"date":1514843425000,"rawContent":"I was told to be careful posting b\/c it might affect my career. Saying NO to sexual harassment &amp; defending myself against sexual assault has already affected my career.  #TimesUp! Please look up the website &amp; #donate\u231b\ud83c\udfac\n#GoldenGlobes #actress #metoo  \n https:\/\/t.co\/6HFOdphMUx","userId":793060405,"media":null,"username":"lisa_catara","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":12,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":949882516688662528,"date":1515304614000,"rawContent":"Thankful many remain vocal. Though why choose to wear black at the #GoldenGlobes? Black is common at awards venues and is also associated w\/loss. If you want to make a statement of Power and Transcendence, why not BRIGHT colors!? #metoo #timesup https:\/\/t.co\/KBSqIxxvhS","userId":793060405,"media":null,"username":"lisa_catara","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":13,"sumOfClimate":0,"roll